    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d799">

                <pb facs="0865" n="753" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg753"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Consul Olivares.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-06-19"><hi rendition="#italic">June 19,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Knox instructs Mr. Olivares to communicate to the Estrada faction and make
                    public the following statement, which has been handed by the consul at Managua
                    to Dr. Madriz, who had addressed a telegram to the President.<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d799-f1"/></p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
